<main data-pagefind-body="" id="main"><section class="reference-intro" id="top"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Reading paths</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">A PATH THROUGH THE HERITAGE</p><h1>Reading paths</h1><p>Choose a starting point, then follow a sequence of connected pages.</p></section><div class="reader-grid section"><section class="reader-panel" id="path-1"><p class="eyebrow">PATH 01</p><h2>Start here</h2><p>A gentle introduction to the ideas, divine forms and stories of Sanatan <a class="glossary-link" href="/glossary.html#dharma" title="dharma: glossary definition">Dharma</a>.</p><ol class="reading-steps"><li><a href="/understanding.html">Understand the foundations</a><small>Begin with dharma, karma and the paths of spiritual life.</small></li><li><a href="/deities.html">Meet the Divine</a><small>Explore the gods and goddesses across traditions.</small></li><li><a href="/hanuman-lanka.html">Hanuman’s leap to Lanka</a><small>Full story · courage and thoughtful service.</small></li><li><a href="/lalita-bhandasura.html">Lalita and Bhandasura</a><small>Read a complete illustrated narrative.</small></li><li><a href="/shiva-parvati.html">Shiva and Parvati</a><small>Full story · devotion, tapas and the divine wedding.</small></li><li><a href="/krishna-govardhana.html">Krishna and Govardhana</a><small>Full story · shelter, devotion and humility.</small></li><li><a href="/rama-exile.html">Rama’s exile</a><small>Full story · commitment, companionship and a changed future.</small></li></ol></section><section class="reader-panel" id="path-2"><p class="eyebrow">PATH 02</p><h2>Stories of courage</h2><p>Three encounters with resolve, protection and divine strength.</p><ol class="reading-steps"><li><a href="/hanuman-lanka.html">Hanuman’s leap to Lanka</a><small>Full story · courage and judgment.</small></li><li><a href="/devi-mahishasura.html">Devi and Mahishasura</a><small>Full story · the Goddess confronts oppression.</small></li><li><a href="/lalita-bhandasura.html">Lalita and Bhandasura</a><small>Full story · protection and renewal.</small></li></ol></section><section class="reader-panel" id="path-3"><p class="eyebrow">PATH 03</p><h2>Enter the Ramayana</h2><p>Follow three episodes in narrative order, from an ancestral tale to the search for Sita.</p><ol class="reading-steps"><li><a href="/bhagiratha-ganga.html">Bhagiratha brings the Ganga</a><small>Full story · Bala Kanda · an ancestral quest and the Ganga’s descent.</small></li><li><a href="/rama-exile.html">Rama leaves Ayodhya</a><small>Full story · Ayodhya Kanda · duty and the forest journey.</small></li><li><a href="/hanuman-lanka.html">Hanuman’s leap to Lanka</a><small>Full story · Sundara Kanda · the search for Sita.</small></li></ol></section><section class="reader-panel" id="path-4"><p class="eyebrow">PATH 04</p><h2>Stories of Shiva</h2><p>Meet the great yogin through devotion, divine companionship and compassion.</p><ol class="reading-steps"><li><a href="/deities.html#shiva">Meet Shiva</a><small>Begin with his forms and attributes.</small></li><li><a href="/shiva-parvati.html">Shiva and Parvati</a><small>Full story · Parvati’s tapas and the divine wedding.</small></li><li><a href="/shiva-halahala.html">Shiva drinks Halahala</a><small>Full story · compassion in the ocean-churning narrative.</small></li></ol></section></div></main>
